      "solution": "n = int(input())\nb = list(map(int, input().split()))\n\ndiffs = [b[i + 1] - b[i] for i in range(n - 1)]\nstep = max(set(diffs), key=diffs.count)\n\nfor i in range(n - 1):\n    if b[i + 1] - b[i] != step:\n        if i + 1 < n - 1 and b[i + 2] - b[i + 1] == step:\n            print(i)\n        else:\n            print(i + 1)\n        break",
